<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Electricity Resistance</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 8), Conjurer (guild level 17)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast electricity resistance &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast electricity resistance</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Raises the target's electricity sphere for about ten minutes. Your ability in 
a sphere also protects you against its spells (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>), so the 
target resists electric spells better: jolt, electrical shock, lightning bolt, 
call lightning, lightning storm and lightning breath. The better your 
protection sphere, the bigger the raise, up to ten points and a little more 
for a master.
</p><p>It doesn't add up: cast on someone who already has it, the magic just 
dissipates. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on potions, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Heat Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>